#: src/Admin/Settings.php:163
msgid "Right of Withdrawal"
msgstr "Derecho de desistimiento"

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:164
msgid ""
"Complies with EU Directive 2023/2673 (Art. 11a): an easy withdrawal function "
"letting customers declare a full or partial withdrawal for their orders. "
"Requests are logged under WooCommerce > Withdrawal Requests."
msgstr ""
"Cumple con la Directiva de la UE 2023/2673 (Art. 11a): una función de "
"desistimiento sencilla que permite a los clientes declarar un desistimiento "
"total o parcial de sus pedidos. Las solicitudes se registran en WooCommerce "
"> Solicitudes de desistimiento."

