msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:346
msgid ""
"Neither this field nor your WooCommerce store address is filled in, so the "
"acceptance message will not say where to send the goods."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:349
msgid "Who pays to send the goods back"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:351
msgid "Say nothing"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:352
msgid "The customer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:353
msgid "We do"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:355
msgid ""
"Article 14(1) only lets you charge the customer for the return if you told "
"them so before they bought, in your withdrawal information. If you did not, "
"the cost is yours, which is why this says nothing until you choose."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:358
msgid "Return cost, extra wording"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:359
msgid ""
"Optional, added after the sentence above. Article 6(1)(i) wants an estimate "
"of the cost for goods that cannot normally be sent back by post."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:360
msgid "For example: bulky items are collected by courier, around 40 EUR."
msgstr ""

